    "detailed_description": "Air Offense Command takes place in an alternate historical setting in the year 1941. You are taking part in a suprise attack on the Commonwealth of Anacrea. Why? Not your place to ask. Your tasks are:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>STRATEGIC - inflict maximum damage on the enemy to break their fighting spirit.<br></li><li>OPERATIONAL - upgrade your ragtag air force with better plane, bombs, rockets, armor and engines.<br></li><li>TACTICAL - dodge enemy cannon, flak, guided missiles and fighters while delivering your own ordnance with pinpoint accuracy.<br></li><li>Currently included aircraft: Ju-87, B5N, two variants of Tu-2, P61, Do-335, Go-229, Yak-15, and last and very much least the I-153 if you are <i>really</i> desperate.</li></ul>",
